<p>Delight in spilling the blood of your foes.  After scoring a critical hit, your maximum hit points will be increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3%, 6%, 9%, 10%, 12%,</acronym> your life regeneration by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.70, 2.81, 3.65, 4.37, 5.00</acronym> per turn, and your stamina regeneration by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0.34, 0.56, 0.73, 0.87, 1.00</acronym> per turn for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">6, 7, 8, 9, 10</acronym> turns.</p><p>The life and stamina regeneration will stack up to five times, for a maximum of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8.50, 14, 18, 22, 25</acronym> and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.70, 2.81, 3.65, 4.37, 5.00</acronym> each turn, respectively.</p>